== [1] FREE FIELD : G'' = Delta_dyn + W_full ==
  periodic continuum / flat chart: Phi = 0, S quadratic, Stein  E[H] = Var(G)
     => Delta_dyn = 0 ,  W_full = 0  =>  G'' = 0   (exact)
  finite Dirichlet box (the '0.6169' column): G'' = pi^2/L^2 -> 0
     L=  2  pi^2/L^2 = 2.467401   4pi^2/L^2 = 9.869604
     L=  4  pi^2/L^2 = 0.616850   4pi^2/L^2 = 2.467401
     L=  8  pi^2/L^2 = 0.154213   4pi^2/L^2 = 0.616850
     L= 16  pi^2/L^2 = 0.038553   4pi^2/L^2 = 0.154213
     L= 64  pi^2/L^2 = 0.002410   4pi^2/L^2 = 0.009638
  => free field is FALSE for any fixed delta_W>0 (delta_W may -> 0 with L, or G''=0)

