   G'' = S - D = +0.135994711041988  [E] (T03-TOY:50, q11 anchor, |diff| 1.1e-16)
   m : UNDEFINED (0 dims, no transfer matrix, no E1).  no scale ladder j => 'uniform in j' empty

== [5] SIGNATURE of (star) vs the four-model touchstone (False/True/False/undef) ==
   reading (P) pointwise in the coarse amplitude, a-sector only:
       free 0 (F) | 2D >=2 (T) | M6 2omega>0 (T) | plaquette 0.136 but m undef -> (F,T,T,undef)  => FAIL
   reading (Q) inf over all coarse sectors:
       free 0 (F) | 2D >=2 (T) | M6 min(2omega,0)=0 (F) | plaquette undef -> (F,T,F,undef)  => PASS
   BUT (Q) is carried on 2D by W_geo = 2/sin^2(phi): pure Haar/Jacobian, t-independent, kinematics.
   => (Q) is a 'is the coarse coordinate non-flat?' detector, not a gap detector.
   witness: at t=40 D_dyn ~ 1e-34 (dynamics switched off), G'' >= 2 unchanged.

